1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,342
Don’t say: I am agree.

2
00:00:02,342 --> 00:00:04,685
Say: I agree.

3
00:00:04,685 --> 00:00:07,028
Wrong: I am agree.

4
00:00:07,028 --> 00:00:09,371
Correct: I agree.

5
00:00:09,371 --> 00:00:11,714
Quick rule:

6
00:00:11,714 --> 00:00:14,057
Agree is a verb, so do not use am before it.

7
00:00:14,057 --> 00:00:16,399
Follow for daily English corrections.
